      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Multi line editing </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Make relative / absolute for the currently selected line(s) </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Prepend .. / Remove .. for the currently selected line(s) </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Move current line up or down with the arrow buttons or Ctrl + up/down arrow keys </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Favorites menu for currently used paths (if items available, open popup for selecting item in the other case open the favorites form directly)</text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="margin-top:3px; margin-bottom:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">A simple way to select the target for which to edit the path </text></li>
